          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sNDA provides for updates to the Use in Specific Populations, Pediatric Use (8.4) subsection of the package insert (PI) to include the results from clinical study 1200.120, conducted to fulfill the April 7, 2017, original Written Request for pediatric studies for afatinib, as amended by our August 14, 2017, June 5, 2019, April 29, 2020 and July 26, 2021, amended Written Request Letters. Additional revisions were made to the Patient Package Insert to better align with FDA regulations, labeling guidelines, policies and practices.",
